### Pariose Backend - Ecclesiastical Units API Tests
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### Get Token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### 1. Create Diocese (Root Unit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "libelle": "Diocese of Lyon",
  "description": "Diocese covering the Lyon metropolitan area",
  "code_type": 1,
  "statut_canonique": "Active",
  "adresse": "Place Bellecour, Lyon, France",
  "latitude": 45.7640,
  "longitude": 4.8357,
  "date_creation_unite": "1900-01-01",
  "fidele": "250000"
}

### 2. Create Parish (Child of Diocese)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "libelle": "St. Jean Parish",
  "description": "Historic parish in old Lyon",
  "code_type": 2,
  "code_unite_parent": 1,
  "statut_canonique": "Active",
  "adresse": "Rue St. Jean, Lyon",
  "latitude": 45.7630,
  "longitude": 4.8270
}

### 3. Create Chapel (Grandchild)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "libelle": "Notre Dame Chapel",
  "description": "Small chapel for prayer",
  "code_type": 3,
  "code_unite_parent": 2,
  "latitude": 45.7650,
  "longitude": 4.8300
}

### 4. List All Units
GET {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Search Units
GET {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units?search=chapel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Filter by Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units?code_type=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Filter by Parent (Get Parishes of Diocese 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units?code_unite_parent=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Get Root Units Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units?code_unite_parent=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Location-Based Search (Within 10km)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units?latitude=45.7640&longitude=4.8357&radius=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Get Hierarchy Tree
GET {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units/hierarchy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Get Specific Hierarchy
GET {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units/hierarchy?rootId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Get Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Get Specific Unit
GET {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Update Unit
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "description": "Updated description with more details",
  "statut_canonique": "Active - Major Restoration"
}

### 15. Subscribe to Unit
POST {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units/2/subscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Get My Subscriptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units/my-subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Get Unit Subscribers
GET {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units/2/subscribers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. Unsubscribe from Unit
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units/2/subscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19. Try to Create Circular Reference (Should Fail)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code_unite_parent": 2
}

### 20. Try to Delete Unit with Children (Should Fail)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21. Create Unit with Self as Parent (Should Fail)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code_unite_parent": 2
}

### 22. Delete Leaf Unit (Should Succeed)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 23. Create Unit as Regular User (Should Fail)
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "demouser",
  "password": "Demo1234"
}

@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.access_token}}

POST {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "libelle": "Unauthorized Unit",
  "code_type": 2
}

### 24. User Can View Units
GET {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 25. User Can Subscribe
POST {{baseUrl}}/ecclesiastical-units/2/subscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
